    "passives": {
      "MatchMakerPassiveACupidRegular": {
        "id": "MatchMakerPassiveACupidRegular",
        "found": true,
        "localization": {
          "name": "Sorceress of True Love",
          "description": "This unit starts with Cupid's Link. When this unit enters battle it grants Cupid's Link for 50TU to another random non-conjured ally that does not have a Link already. Then that ally and this unit are Fortified, and granted an Instant Death Ward.\n\nA unit with Cupid's Link has these effects:\n\nThis unit cannot become Charmed.\n\nEach time an ally with Cupid's Link gets the turn, this unit will be healed for 50% of its max HP.\n\nThis unit has 0.25x of their original Attack added to their Attack while they are not Enraged. This increase will stack with other Attack increases (e.g. 1.5x + 0.25x => 1.75x total).\n\nWhen this unit defeats an enemy with an attack, after the end of the turn, all other allies with Cupid's Link will be given the next turns by reducing their current TU, and become Purified. Effects that influence TU order may interrupt the extra turn (e.g. Stuns targeting the lowest TU target). These TU reductions may trigger before or after other effects that adjust the turn order.\n\nThis Link is removed if this unit or the unit that granted it leaves the battlefield. This unit cannot gain other Links."
        }
      },
      "AngelOfLovePassiveACupidRegular": {
        "id": "AngelOfLovePassiveACupidRegular",
        "found": true,
        "localization": {
          "name": "Winged Sweetheart",
          "description": "This unit enters battle with a Sleep Ward, and Poison Ward.\n\nThis unit cannot be stunned or be sent to the reinforcements from the battlefield.\n\nIf this unit would be defeated by an enemy attack or a status effect while having more than 1 HP, it instead survives with 1 HP.\n\nThis unit has 25% damage reduction from attacks. While there are 2 Linked allies on the battlefield, this unit has 50% damage reduction from attacks instead.\n\nThis unit's attacks heal this unit for 100% of total damage dealt, will not wake sleeping enemies, ignore damage reduction effects, and any effects of non-boss enemies that would prevent targets from being defeated.\n\nThe first time this unit is damaged by an enemy attack and survives until after the end of the turn, there is a 20% chance, plus 20% chance per Awakening (up to 100% chance if this unit has 4 Awakenings) for this unit to Charm all enemies on the battlefield for 50TU. Whenever this unit uses Restore Cupid's Link, this effect is reset so it can trigger again.\n\nEach time this unit takes damage from an attack and survives until after the end of the turn, this unit will be Purified, and heal for 25% of its max HP.\n\nA Charmed unit has their attack greatly reduced (e.g. to 0.5x of their original Attack for a unit with no other Attack modifiers. The effect of Charmed may be diminished if the affected unit's Attack is increased by other effects). Charmed overwrites Enrage and Weaken effects, and units that are Charmed cannot be Enraged or Weakened. Charmed units are less likely to target the unit that Charmed them with most active skills. Charmed is not a status effect and cannot be removed by Purify skills, but will end if the Charmed unit leaves the battlefield."
        }
      },
